.TH "RPIMONITOR-DAEMON.CONF" "5" "Oct 18, 2026" "2.13" "RPi-Monitor"
.SH NAME
rpimonitor-daemon.conf \- RPi-Monitor daemon configuration
.SH GLOBAL CONFIGURATION
.sp
\fBdaemon\fP is defining the behavior of \fBrpimonitord\fP\&.
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B daemon.sharedmemkey=20130906
Define the share memory key (Default: 20130906)
.TP
.B daemon.delay=10
Define the delay in seconds between 2 KPIs extraction (Default: 10)
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBImportant:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
If you want to change the default delay, the rrd files in \fB/var/lib/rpimonitor/stat\fP
have to be deleted. \fBrpimonitord\fP will recreate these files at next startup.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B daemon.timeout=5
Define the maximum duration in seconds of KPI extraction. If this timeout is triggered, KPI
value will depends on default value configured for this KPI. (Default: 5)
.TP
.B daemon.noserver=0
Tell \fBrpimonitord\fP to not start web server (Default: 0)
.TP
.B daemon.readonly=1
Tell \fBrpimonitord\fP to not write data on disk. (Default: 0)
.TP
.B daemon.addr=0.0.0.0
Define the address used by the embedded web server (Default: 0.0.0.0)
.TP
.B daemon.port=8888
Define port of the embedded web server (Default: 8888)
.TP
.B daemon.user=pi
Define user used to run embedded web server process (Default: pi)
.sp
\fBNote:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
If user is not existing, process will run with \fBuid=1000\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B daemon.group=pi
Define group used to run embedded web server process (Default: pi)
.sp
\fBNote:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
If group is not existing, process will run with \fBgid=1000\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBImportant:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
Extraction daemon of \fBRPi\-Monitor\fP running as root.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B daemon.webroot=/usr/share/rpimonitor/web
Define the root directory of the web server (Default: \fB/usr/share/rpimonitor/web\fP)
.TP
.B daemon.datastore=/var/lib/rpimonitor
Define the data storage directory (Default: \fB/var/lib/rpimonitor\fP).
.TP
.B daemon.logfile=/var/log/rpimonitor.log
Define directory where logs are stored when \fBrpimonitor\fP starts un background (Default: \fB/dev/null\fP)
.sp
\fBNote:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
when \fBrpimonitord\fP is started in foreground, information a written in \fB/dev/stderr\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B daemon.loglevel=0
Define log level (Default:0)
.UNINDENT
.SH SNMP CONFIGURATION
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
\fBsnmpagent\fP is defining SNMP behavior of \fBrpimonitord\fP\&.
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B snmpagent.rootoid=.1.3.6.1.4.1
Define root OID for snmp\-agent (Default: .1.3.6.1.4.1)
.TP
.B snmpagent.enterpriseoid=54321
Define enterprise OID for snmp agent (Default: 54321)
.TP
.B snmpagent.rpimonitoroid=42
Define rpimonitor OID for snmp agent (Default: 42)
.TP
.B snmpagent.mibname=RPIMONITOR\-MIB
Define MIB name (Default: RPIMONITOR\-MIB)
.TP
.B snmpagent.lastupdate=201802030000Z
Define MIB last update field (Default: 201802030000Z)
.TP
.B snmpagent.moduleidentity=rpi\-experiences
Define MIB module identity (Default: rpi\-experiences)
.TP
.B snmpagent.organisation=RPi\-Monitor
Define MIB organisation (Default: RPi\-Monitor)
.TP
.B snmpagent.contactionfo=http://rpi\-experiences.blogspot.fr/
Define MIB contact info (Default: \%<http://\:rpi-experiences\:.blogspot\:.fr/>)
.TP
.B snmpagent.description=description
Define MIB description (Default: description)
.TP
.B snmpagent.revision=201802030000Z
Define MIB revision (Default: 201802030000Z)
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
